@Verbotene_Wahrheit

Peskov on the militarization of the EU:

The escalation of the European Union towards Russia is forcing Moscow to plan additional measures to ensure its own security. The fact that, as the European Union develops its defense identity, it has embarked on a path of militarization and is dedicating itself to the issue of confrontation with the Russian Federation is also clear. Of course, we cannot turn a blind eye to this. But one thing should not be in doubt: the reliable security of the Russian Federation and its national interests will be guaranteed.

@Slavyangrad
